---
description: PHP quality gates through ub-mode-php
globs: "**/*.php"
alwaysApply: false
---

After changing PHP, run configured project tests and `ub-php check --changed --format json`. Review duplicates with `ub-php dry --changed --threshold 0.8`. Keep unknown coverage distinct from zero and report unavailable mutation/UML gates as skipped. Do not lower thresholds to pass checks.
